{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only one rule:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light eight candles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Yatsuakari&quot; is a Japanese-style walking simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a maze-like field shrouded in darkness,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and light eight randomly placed candles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Their locations will change when returning to the title screen.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game includes horror elements and jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since some events rely on audio cues,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">we recommend using speakers or headphones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Estimated Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 1\u20132 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Video Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both individuals and organizations are allowed to post or stream videos without prior permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monetization is allowed only if done through features provided by video streaming platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We would appreciate it if you could include the game title in your video/stream title and provide a link to the Steam page in the description.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are not responsible for any damages arising from video posting or streaming of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843500?t=1752747463","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843500/bee893ebbfad840ebf0608ec3884bfaddee8dff0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752747463","